{"arguments": {"topic": "minimum number of quotations required"}, "checks": [], "error": null, "prompt": "run_agent item_id=INV-005", "result": {"policy_section": "2. Quotation requirement", "rule": "## 2. Quotation requirement\n\n2.1 A minimum of **three valid quotations** must be obtained for any requisition with a total value of UGX 1,000,000 or above.\n2.2 Below UGX 1,000,000, a minimum of **two valid quotations** is required.\n2.3 A quotation is valid only if it is within its stated validity period on the date the requisition is prepared. A quotation whose validity period has lapsed must be excluded from comparison.\n2.4 A quotation must state the item, the quantity, the unit of measure, the rate, and the treatment of value-added tax. A quotation that does not state its unit of measure is incomplete and must not be used until the supplier clarifies it.", "score": 0.6746, "source": "knowledge\\policy\\procurement-policy.md", "status": "found", "topic": "minimum number of quotations required"}, "run_id": "1b8cb9bf-1aef-4bbe-a104-118e41505954", "status": "success", "timestamp": "2026-10-23T02:06:05.035852+00:00", "tool_name": "lookup_policy"}
{"arguments": {"topic": "approval threshold for requisitions"}, "checks": [], "error": null, "prompt": "run_agent item_id=INV-005", "result": {"policy_section": "5. Approval thresholds", "rule": "## 5. Approval thresholds\n\n5.1 Requisitions up to UGX 5,000,000 require approval by the operations manager.\n5.2 Requisitions above UGX 5,000,000 require approval by a director.\n5.3 No requisition is approved by virtue of its value being small. Every requisition requires an approval decision by a person.\n5.4 The officer preparing a requisition may not approve it.", "score": 0.751, "source": "knowledge\\policy\\procurement-policy.md", "status": "found", "topic": "approval threshold for requisitions"}, "run_id": "1b8cb9bf-1aef-4bbe-a104-118e41505954", "status": "success", "timestamp": "2026-10-23T02:06:05.035852+00:00", "tool_name": "lookup_policy"}
